    <docsUrl>https://github.com/filesfm/Sync/blob/main/README.md</docsUrl>
    <bugTrackerUrl>https://github.com/filesfm/Sync/issues</bugTrackerUrl>
    <tags>files-fm sync file-sync webdav desktop qt</tags>
    <summary>Files.fm Sync desktop client</summary>
    <description>Files.fm Sync keeps a local folder synchronized with your Files.fm storage, built on the Nextcloud desktop sync engine. A Files.fm account is required; free accounts include limited storage, with paid plans available for more.</description>
